{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、こんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第76回NHK紅白歌合戦に乃木坂46が出場させていただけることになりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に本当に嬉しいです！\nありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は物心がつく前から、大晦日に家族で紅白歌合戦を観させていただいていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し大きくなってからは、いとこと紅白の鉢巻を巻いて、テレビの前に張りついていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "NHK紅白歌合戦は私が音楽を好きになったきっかけの１つです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩方が築いて繋いできてくださったから、私はたくさん経験をさせていただいています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「乃木坂46」の一員として、このような素敵なお知らせを聞けたことが本当に幸せです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大きすぎる先輩方の背中を、これからも必死で追いかけます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobwyZ2Wk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46が大好きです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "EX大衆 12月号"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五百城さんと掲載していただいています！\nぜひ手に取っていただけると嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日、新参者夜公演！\nがんばります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}